  "armyWideRules": [
    "All undead models are immune to psychology, immune to poison, and cause fear.",
    "Undead models may only march while within 12 inches of the general, except undead characters and ethereal models as described in the army rules.",
    "The only charge reaction available to undead models is Hold.",
    "Undead models are either unstable, subject to the crumble rule, or unbreakable.",
    "If the general is slain, undead units crumble immediately unless protected by an eligible character-led-unit exception.",
    "Ethereal models are unstable, always skirmish, may always march, move through solid objects and difficult terrain, can only be harmed by magical attacks, and make magical attacks themselves.",
    "Wights always carry a Wight-Blade unless replaced by another magic weapon; Wraiths always carry a Wraith-Weapon unless replaced by another magic weapon."
  ],
